Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"alloydb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。区域内基于日志的分布式存储层同步复制；跨区为异步 secondary cluster 复制。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。区域内基于日志的分布式存储层同步复制；跨区为异步 secondary cluster 复制。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes. Log-based distributed storage-layer synchronous replication within a region; asynchronous secondary cluster replication across regions. Source level: official docs</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Yes</strong>. Log-based distributed storage-layer synchronous replication within a region; asynchronous secondary cluster replication across regions. Source level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向为主 + 读横向扩展</span><p class=\"snippet\">纵向为主 + 读横向扩展。主实例纵向扩缩（官方称近乎无中断）；读扩展靠 read pool（全集群最多 20 个读节点，共享同一份存储，读副本不产生额外存储费用）；写扩展上限为主实例规格——不是 Spanner 式的无上限水平写扩展。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>纵向为主 + 读横向扩展。主实例纵向扩缩（官方称近乎无中断）；读扩展靠 read pool（全集群最多 20 个读节点，共享同一份存储，读副本不产生额外存储费用）；写扩展上限为主实例规格——不是 Spanner 式的无上限水平写扩展。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Primarily vertical</span><p class=\"snippet\">Primarily vertical + read scale-out. Primary instance vertical scaling (officially described as near-zero-downtime); read scaling via read pools (up to 20 read nodes per …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Primarily vertical + read scale-out. Primary instance vertical scaling (officially described as near-zero-downtime); read scaling via read pools (up to 20 read nodes per cluster, sharing the same storage; read replicas incur no additional storage charges); write scaling ceiling is the primary instance size — not the unbounded horizontal write scaling of Spanner. Source level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。集群级 KMS AES-256，覆盖存储卷、自动备份、快照、副本；创建时开启，创建后不可修改（immutable，要加密旧库只能快照→加密复制→恢复→切换）。注意两点反直觉：MySQL 的 InnoDB 表空间级 TDE（ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;）不支持（查证为无），keyring 插件全系不支持——加密是卷级的，不是…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。集群级 KMS AES-256，覆盖存储卷、自动备份、快照、副本；<strong>创建时开启，创建后不可修改</strong>（immutable，要加密旧库只能快照→加密复制→恢复→切换）。注意两点反直觉：MySQL 的 InnoDB 表空间级 TDE（<code>ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;</code>）<strong>不支持</strong>（查证为无），keyring 插件全系不支持——加密是卷级的，不是表级的。新集群默认开启加密为社区说法，<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cluster-level KMS AES-256, covering storage volumes, automated backups, snapshots, replicas; enabled at creation time and immutable afterward (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cluster-level KMS AES-256, covering storage volumes, automated backups, snapshots, replicas; <strong>enabled at creation time and immutable afterward</strong> (to encrypt an existing cluster you must snapshot → copy with encryption → restore → cut over). Two counter-intuitive notes: MySQL InnoDB tablespace-level TDE (<code>ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;</code>) is <strong>unsupported</strong> (verified absent), and keyring plugins are unsupported across the board — encryption is at the volume level, not the table level. &quot;New clusters have encryption on by default&quot; is a community claim, <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS/SSL；Aurora MySQL 8.4 新集群默认强制 TLS（仅 1.2/1.3）；MySQL 侧 require_secure_transport、PG 侧 rds.force_ssl。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS/SSL；Aurora MySQL 8.4 新集群默认强制 TLS（仅 1.2/1.3）；MySQL 侧 <code>require_secure_transport</code>、PG 侧 <code>rds.force_ssl</code>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS/SSL; Aurora MySQL 8.4 new clusters enforce TLS by default (1.2/1.3 only); require_secure_transport on the MySQL side, rds.force_ssl on the …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS/SSL; Aurora MySQL 8.4 new clusters enforce TLS by default (1.2/1.3 only); <code>require_secure_transport</code> on the MySQL side, <code>rds.force_ssl</code> on the PG side.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档 + 社区共识）。MySQL 协议（3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45；8.4 ~ 社区 8.4.7 LTS 且版本号对齐）、PG 协议（18.4 等）。JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium 等生态工具通用。PG 扩展为白名单制（SHOW rds.extensions），冷门扩展无自助安装通道。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档 + 社区共识）。MySQL 协议（3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45；8.4 ~ 社区 8.4.7 LTS 且版本号对齐）、PG 协议（18.4 等）。JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium 等生态工具通用。PG 扩展为白名单制（<code>SHOW rds.extensions</code>），冷门扩展无自助安装通道。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">MySQL protocol</span><p class=\"snippet\">MySQL protocol (3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45; 8.4 ~ community 8.4.7 LTS with aligned version numbers), PG protocol (18.4, etc.). JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium ecosystem tools all wor…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>MySQL protocol (3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45; 8.4 ~ community 8.4.7 LTS with aligned version numbers), PG protocol (18.4, etc.). JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium ecosystem tools all work. PG extensions are whitelist-based (<code>SHOW rds.extensions</code>); obscure extensions have no self-service installation channel.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档，闭源商业 + 厂商口径计费模型）。闭源商业，按量付费：计算（实例小时 / ACU-秒）+ 存储（GB-月）+ I/O（Standard 版按百万次）+ 备份/传输；Database Savings Plans / RI 可打折；无开源版。AWS 锁定是最大的商业现实：无他云、无自建，迁出=逻辑迁移。只写计费模型，不写绝对标价…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档，闭源商业 + 厂商口径计费模型）。闭源商业，按量付费：计算（实例小时 / ACU-秒）+ 存储（GB-月）+ I/O（Standard 版按百万次）+ 备份/传输；Database Savings Plans / RI 可打折；无开源版。<strong>AWS 锁定是最大的商业现实</strong>：无他云、无自建，迁出=逻辑迁移。只写计费模型，不写绝对标价。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p class=\"snippet\">Closed-source commercial, pay-as-you-go: compute (instance-hours / ACU-seconds) + storage (GB-month) + I/O (Standard edition billed per million I/Os) + backup/transfer; D…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Closed-source commercial, pay-as-you-go: compute (instance-hours / ACU-seconds) + storage (GB-month) + I/O (Standard edition billed per million I/Os) + backup/transfer; Database Savings Plans / RIs can discount; no open-source edition. <strong>AWS lock-in is the biggest commercial reality</strong>: no other cloud, no self-hosted edition, leaving = logical migration.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p class=\"snippet\">中等<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/博客）不少，但深度调优、故障排查内容多为英文（re:Post、AWS Blog）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>中等</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/博客）不少，但深度调优、故障排查内容多为英文（re:Post、AWS Blog）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Moderate</span><p class=\"snippet\">Moderate <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/blogs) are plentiful, but d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Moderate</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/blogs) are plentiful, but deep tuning and troubleshooting content is mostly in English (re:Post, AWS Blog).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算分离；读扩展与故障恢复快）。 读副本共享存储卷，加节点不复制数据；故障恢复通常秒级（存储层仲裁）官方文档。 写仍是单 writer 上限；延迟与 vanilla MySQL/PG 相近 社区共识。 Serverless v2 支持自动纵向伸缩，应对波峰 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算分离；读扩展与故障恢复快）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>读副本共享存储卷，加节点不复制数据；故障恢复通常秒级（存储层仲裁）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写仍是单 writer 上限；延迟与 vanilla MySQL/PG 相近 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless v2 支持自动纵向伸缩，应对波峰 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (storage-compute separation; fast read scaling and recovery). Read replicas share the storage volume — no data copy when scaling; failover typically in seconds …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (storage-compute separation; fast read scaling and recovery).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Read replicas share the storage volume — no data copy when scaling; failover typically in seconds (storage-layer quorum) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Writes still capped by the single writer; latency close to vanilla MySQL/PG <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless v2 auto-scales vertically for spiky workloads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（继承 AWS 合规体系；中国区走光环/西云）。 AWS：SOC2、ISO27001、PCI DSS 等<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 中国区（北京/宁夏，由光环新网/西云数据运营）参与等保测评 厂商口径。 无信创名录信息；政企选型以上云版本资质为准 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（继承 AWS 合规体系；中国区走光环/西云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS：SOC2、ISO27001、PCI DSS 等<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>中国区（北京/宁夏，由光环新网/西云数据运营）参与等保测评 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>无信创名录信息；政企选型以上云版本资质为准 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (inherits AWS compliance; China regions via local operators). AWS: SOC2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. China regions (Beijing/Ningxia,…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (inherits AWS compliance; China regions via local operators).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS: SOC2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>China regions (Beijing/Ningxia, operated by local partners) undergo MLPS assessment <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>No trusted-innovation catalog information; government/enterprise selection per the cloud edition&#x27;s qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2014 年发布；云原生数据库的开创者）。 2014 年 re:Invent 发布，MySQL/PG 兼容双引擎；AWS 增长最快的服务之一 社区共识。 生产案例极多，调优/排障资料丰富 社区共识。 闭源云服务：行为由 AWS 定义，大版本跟进上游有延迟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2014 年发布；云原生数据库的开创者）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2014 年 re:Invent 发布，MySQL/PG 兼容双引擎；AWS 增长最快的服务之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>生产案例极多，调优/排障资料丰富 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>闭源云服务：行为由 AWS 定义，大版本跟进上游有延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (launched 2014; pioneered the cloud-native database). Launched at re:Invent 2014 with MySQL- and PostgreSQL-compatible engines; among AWS&#x27;s fastest-growing serv…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (launched 2014; pioneered the cloud-native database).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Launched at re:Invent 2014 with MySQL- and PostgreSQL-compatible engines; among AWS&#x27;s fastest-growing services <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Enormous production footprint with rich tuning/troubleshooting material <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Closed cloud service: behavior defined by AWS; major-version tracking of upstream lags <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 上最流行的关系型之一）。 Airbnb、Capital One 等公开案例<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 大量从自建 MySQL/PG 迁移上云的用户 社区共识。 中国区（宁夏/北京）亦有规模化用户 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 上最流行的关系型之一）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Airbnb、Capital One 等公开案例<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>大量从自建 MySQL/PG 迁移上云的用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>中国区（宁夏/北京）亦有规模化用户 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (among the most popular relationals on AWS). Public cases: Airbnb, Capital One, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Huge numbers migrating from self-hosted MySQ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (among the most popular relationals on AWS).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public cases: Airbnb, Capital One, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Huge numbers migrating from self-hosted MySQL/PG <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Scaled adoption in China regions (Ningxia/Beijing) too <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS DMS+快照/PITR 全托管）。 迁移：AWS DMS（异构/同构）；快照共享跨账号/跨区 官方文档。 备份：连续备份到 S3，PITR 到秒级 官方文档。 监控：CloudWatch/Performance Insights；CDC：DMS/Kinesis 集成 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS DMS+快照/PITR 全托管）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迁移：AWS DMS（异构/同构）；快照共享跨账号/跨区 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>备份：连续备份到 S3，PITR 到秒级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>监控：CloudWatch/Performance Insights；CDC：DMS/Kinesis 集成 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS DMS + fully managed snapshots/PITR). Migration: AWS DMS (heterogeneous/homogeneous); snapshot sharing across accounts/regions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Backup: cont…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS DMS + fully managed snapshots/PITR).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Migration: AWS DMS (heterogeneous/homogeneous); snapshot sharing across accounts/regions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Backup: continuous backup to S3 with second-granularity PITR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Monitoring: CloudWatch/Performance Insights; CDC via DMS/Kinesis integration <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（本身就是云服务；Serverless v2）。 Aurora 本身就是 AWS 托管服务；Serverless v2 自动伸缩 官方文档。 Global Database 跨区，Backtrack 回拨 官方文档。 AWS 绑定，无本地版（Outposts 除外）社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（本身就是云服务；Serverless v2）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora 本身就是 AWS 托管服务；Serverless v2 自动伸缩 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Global Database 跨区，Backtrack 回拨 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>AWS 绑定，无本地版（Outposts 除外）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (is itself a cloud service; Serverless v2). Aurora is itself an AWS managed service; Serverless v2 auto-scales <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Global Database across regions; …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (is itself a cloud service; Serverless v2).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora is itself an AWS managed service; Serverless v2 auto-scales <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Global Database across regions; Backtrack rewind <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>AWS-bound; no on-premises edition (except Outposts) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（S3 直导（LOAD DATA FROM S3/aws_s3）；DMS）。 Aurora MySQL：LOAD DATA FROM S3 并行导入；Aurora PG：aws_s3 扩展从 S3 导入/导出 官方文档。 DMS 支持同构/异构迁移与持续复制 官方文档。 跨区/跨账号 S3 导入注意 IAM 权限与网络 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（S3 直导（LOAD DATA FROM S3/aws_s3）；DMS）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：LOAD DATA FROM S3 并行导入；Aurora PG：aws_s3 扩展从 S3 导入/导出 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DMS 支持同构/异构迁移与持续复制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区/跨账号 S3 导入注意 IAM 权限与网络 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Direct S3 load (LOAD DATA FROM S3/aws_s3); DMS). Aurora MySQL: parallel LOAD DATA FROM S3; Aurora PG: aws_s3 extension for S3 import/export <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. DM…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Direct S3 load (LOAD DATA FROM S3/aws_s3); DMS).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: parallel LOAD DATA FROM S3; Aurora PG: aws_s3 extension for S3 import/export <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DMS supports homogeneous/heterogeneous migration and ongoing replication <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region/cross-account S3 loads need IAM and network care <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Database Activity Streams（近实时活动流，KMS 加密，sync/async 两种模式，async 高负载可能丢日志）；Aurora MySQL 支持 MariaDB Audit Plugin（高级审计）；PG 支持 pgaudit 扩展；日志可导出 CloudWatch。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Database Activity Streams（近实时活动流，KMS 加密，sync/async 两种模式，async 高负载可能丢日志）；Aurora MySQL 支持 MariaDB Audit Plugin（高级审计）；PG 支持 pgaudit 扩展；日志可导出 CloudWatch。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Database Activity Streams (near-real-time activity stream, KMS-encrypted, sync/async modes; async mode can drop logs under heavy load); Aurora …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Database Activity Streams (near-real-time activity stream, KMS-encrypted, sync/async modes; async mode can drop logs under heavy load); Aurora MySQL supports the MariaDB Audit Plugin (advanced auditing); PG supports the pgaudit extension; logs can be exported to CloudWatch.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 版经 aurora_analytics 直查湖仓；MySQL 版无外部表语义）。 Aurora PG：postgres_fdw、dblink 可用；aws_s3 可读写 S3 对象 官方文档。 Aurora PG 17.11+/18.6+ 新增 aurora_analytics 扩展：DuckDB 内嵌于 Aurora 内…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 版经 aurora_analytics 直查湖仓；MySQL 版无外部表语义）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PG：postgres_fdw、dblink 可用；aws_s3 可读写 S3 对象 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Aurora PG 17.11+/18.6+ 新增 <code>aurora_analytics</code> 扩展：DuckDB 内嵌于 Aurora 内部，可直接建外表查询 Glue Data Catalog 中的 Iceberg 表及 S3/S3 Tables 上的 Parquet/Iceberg 数据，免 ETL；一条 SQL 可联合实时数据（含未提交写入）与湖仓历史数据。谓词下推、列裁剪与实例级缓存均为厂商口径，2026-10-01 由 AWS 官方博客宣布 <code>AWS 官方博客</code>。</li>\n<li>限制与对等风险：仅 PG 版支持，Aurora MySQL 无对应能力；需 IAM role（AuroraAnalytics）+ Glue Catalog 配置；单毫秒级延迟场景仍需 CTAS 物化到原生表（写入走主实例）；尚无独立第三方性能对比，查询加速效果为厂商口径 <code>AWS 官方博客</code>。</li>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：无外部表语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (PG edition queries the lakehouse directly via aurora_analytics; MySQL edition has no external-table semantics). Aurora PG: postgres_fdw and dblink av…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (PG edition queries the lakehouse directly via aurora_analytics; MySQL edition has no external-table semantics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PG: postgres_fdw and dblink available; aws_s3 reads/writes S3 objects <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>New on Aurora PostgreSQL 17.11+/18.6+: the <code>aurora_analytics</code> extension embeds DuckDB inside Aurora to query Iceberg tables in the Glue Data Catalog and Parquet/Iceberg data in S3/S3 Tables as foreign tables — no ETL; a single SQL statement can join live data (including uncommitted writes) with lakehouse history. Predicate pushdown, column pruning, and instance-level caching are vendor claims; announced on the AWS official blog 2026-10-01 <code>(AWS official blog)</code>.</li>\n<li>Limits and matching risks: PostgreSQL edition only — no equivalent on Aurora MySQL; requires an IAM role (AuroraAnalytics) plus Glue Catalog setup; single-digit-ms latency still needs CTAS materialization into native tables (writes go to the writer instance); no independent third-party performance comparison found, so query-acceleration claims remain vendor-stated <code>(AWS official blog)</code>.</li>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（binlog/逻辑复制；DMS、Debezium）。 Aurora MySQL 开 binlog；Aurora PG 开逻辑复制，均可对接 Debezium 官方文档。 DMS 做持续复制到下游 官方文档。 只读副本延迟与主库 binlog 保留期是常见坑 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（binlog/逻辑复制；DMS、Debezium）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL 开 binlog；Aurora PG 开逻辑复制，均可对接 Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DMS 做持续复制到下游 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>只读副本延迟与主库 binlog 保留期是常见坑 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (binlog/logical replication; DMS, Debezium). Aurora MySQL with binlog, Aurora PG with logical replication — both feed Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. DMS for ongoing …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (binlog/logical replication; DMS, Debezium).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL with binlog, Aurora PG with logical replication — both feed Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DMS for ongoing replication downstream <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Replica lag and primary binlog retention are the usual pitfalls <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（分区+event 定时清理；无原生行级TTL）。 MySQL 版：分区表 + event scheduler 定时删过期分区 社区共识。 PG 版：pg_cron + 分区裁剪，沿用 PG 生态做法 官方文档。 无原生行级 TTL；大表逐行 DELETE 又慢又胀 undo 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（分区+event 定时清理；无原生行级TTL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版：分区表 + event scheduler 定时删过期分区 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 版：pg_cron + 分区裁剪，沿用 PG 生态做法 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL；大表逐行 DELETE 又慢又胀 undo <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Partitions + scheduled events; no native row-level TTL). MySQL flavor: partitioned tables + event scheduler to drop expired partitions <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. PG …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Partitions + scheduled events; no native row-level TTL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor: partitioned tables + event scheduler to drop expired partitions <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>PG flavor: pg_cron + partition pruning, same as the PG ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native row-level TTL; row-by-row DELETE on huge tables is slow and bloats undo <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（MySQL 版在线 DDL 有限；PG 版原生）。 Aurora MySQL：InnoDB online DDL，加列多可在线，但改主键/列类型仍重建，大表用 gh-ost 更稳 社区共识。 Aurora PG：同 PG 原生在线 DDL 官方文档。 快照恢复/回溯（backtrack）可作为 DDL 翻车后的兜底 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（MySQL 版在线 DDL 有限；PG 版原生）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：InnoDB online DDL，加列多可在线，但改主键/列类型仍重建，大表用 gh-ost 更稳 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Aurora PG：同 PG 原生在线 DDL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>快照恢复/回溯（backtrack）可作为 DDL 翻车后的兜底 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Limited online DDL on MySQL flavor; native on PG flavor). Aurora MySQL: InnoDB online DDL covers many add-column cases, but PK changes / type changes still rebui…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Limited online DDL on MySQL flavor; native on PG flavor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: InnoDB online DDL covers many add-column cases, but PK changes / type changes still rebuild — gh-ost is safer for huge tables <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Aurora PG: native PG online DDL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Snapshot restore / backtrack can bail out a failed DDL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（集群级隔离；Serverless v2 自动扩缩）。 租户隔离靠多集群/实例，单集群内无资源组限流 社区共识。 Serverless v2 按负载自动扩缩，部分缓解 noisy neighbor 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（集群级隔离；Serverless v2 自动扩缩）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>租户隔离靠多集群/实例，单集群内无资源组限流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless v2 按负载自动扩缩，部分缓解 noisy neighbor <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cluster-level isolation; Serverless v2 auto-scaling). Tenant isolation via multiple clusters/instances; no in-cluster resource-group throttling (community consen…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cluster-level isolation; Serverless v2 auto-scaling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tenant isolation via multiple clusters/instances; no in-cluster resource-group throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless v2 auto-scales with load, partly mitigating noisy neighbors <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Global Database 跨区读；写单主）。 Global Database：一写多读跨区，读延迟低，写仍单 region 官方文档。 跨区故障转移分钟级，有数据丢失窗口（RPO 非零）官方文档。 写多活需应用层分片，无原生方案 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Global Database 跨区读；写单主）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Database：一写多读跨区，读延迟低，写仍单 region <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区故障转移分钟级，有数据丢失窗口（RPO 非零）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写多活需应用层分片，无原生方案 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Global Database cross-region reads; single-writer). Global Database: one writer, cross-region readers with low read latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-region failove…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Global Database cross-region reads; single-writer).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Database: one writer, cross-region readers with low read latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region failover takes minutes with a data-loss window (non-zero RPO) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Multi-writer needs app-layer sharding; no native option <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存储 6 副本，故障切换 15 秒级）。 存储层 6 副本跨 3AZ，计算故障切换通常 15-30 秒 官方文档。 RPO≈0（存储层复制），是其 HA 核心优势 官方文档。 切换期间连接闪断，应用需重试逻辑 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存储 6 副本，故障切换 15 秒级）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层 6 副本跨 3AZ，计算故障切换通常 15-30 秒 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RPO≈0（存储层复制），是其 HA 核心优势 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>切换期间连接闪断，应用需重试逻辑 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (6-way storage replicas; ~15s failover). Storage replicates 6 ways across 3 AZs; compute failover usually 15–30s <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RPO≈0 via storage-layer replic…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (6-way storage replicas; ~15s failover).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Storage replicates 6 ways across 3 AZs; compute failover usually 15–30s <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RPO≈0 via storage-layer replication — its core HA advantage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Connections flap during failover; apps need retry logic <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（随引擎版本；PG版有RLS）。 Aurora PostgreSQL 兼容版继承 PG 原生 RLS；MySQL 兼容版无原生 RLS 官方文档 脱敏可叠加 AWS Glue 数据目录敏感数据识别等云上工具，但属管控面 厂商口径 跨可用区存储复制不改变引擎层语义 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（随引擎版本；PG版有RLS）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PostgreSQL 兼容版继承 PG 原生 RLS；MySQL 兼容版无原生 RLS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>脱敏可叠加 AWS Glue 数据目录敏感数据识别等云上工具，但属管控面 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>跨可用区存储复制不改变引擎层语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Varies by engine; PG edition has RLS). Aurora PostgreSQL-compatible edition inherits native PG RLS; the MySQL-compatible edition has no native RLS (official docs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Varies by engine; PG edition has RLS).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PostgreSQL-compatible edition inherits native PG RLS; the MySQL-compatible edition has no native RLS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Masking can layer on cloud tools like AWS Glue sensitive-data detection, but those are control-plane <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Cross-AZ storage replication does not change engine-level semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MySQL 版 JSON；PG 版 jsonb）。 Aurora MySQL：原生 JSON 二进制类型，虚拟生成列+索引，JSON_TABLE 可用 官方文档。 Aurora PG：jsonb 完整；两引擎 JSON 互不兼容，选型时按引擎看 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MySQL 版 JSON；PG 版 jsonb）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：原生 JSON 二进制类型，虚拟生成列+索引，JSON_TABLE 可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Aurora PG：jsonb 完整；两引擎 JSON 互不兼容，选型时按引擎看 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native JSON (MySQL); jsonb (PG)). Aurora MySQL: native binary JSON, virtual generated columns + indexes, JSON_TABLE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Aurora PG: full jsonb; JSO…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native JSON (MySQL); jsonb (PG)).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: native binary JSON, virtual generated columns + indexes, JSON_TABLE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Aurora PG: full jsonb; JSON features differ by engine, evaluate per engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（ngram 中文分词；PG tsvector）。 MySQL 版：FULLTEXT 索引 + ngram parser 中文分词 官方文档。 相关性排序弱于专业检索引擎，大规模检索仍建议外挂 OpenSearch 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（ngram 中文分词；PG tsvector）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版：FULLTEXT 索引 + ngram parser 中文分词 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>相关性排序弱于专业检索引擎，大规模检索仍建议外挂 OpenSearch <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (FULLTEXT+ngram; tsvector on PG). MySQL flavor: FULLTEXT + ngram parser for Chinese <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Relevance ranking weaker than dedicated search engines; lar…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (FULLTEXT+ngram; tsvector on PG).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor: FULLTEXT + ngram parser for Chinese <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Relevance ranking weaker than dedicated search engines; large-scale search still wants OpenSearch <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。密码、IAM 数据库认证（token 15 分钟有效期）、Secrets Manager 集成、PG 支持 Kerberos/AD。上限是 rds_superuser，无 SUPER 权限：不能改 pg_hba.conf、不能 ALTER SYSTEM、不能建 C 语言函数、不能装非白名单扩展。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。密码、IAM 数据库认证（token 15 分钟有效期）、Secrets Manager 集成、PG 支持 Kerberos/AD。上限是 <code>rds_superuser</code>，<strong>无 SUPER 权限</strong>：不能改 <code>pg_hba.conf</code>、不能 <code>ALTER SYSTEM</code>、不能建 C 语言函数、不能装非白名单扩展。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Passwords, IAM database authentication (tokens valid for 15 minutes), Secrets Manager integration, PG supports Kerberos/AD. The ceiling is rds_…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Passwords, IAM database authentication (tokens valid for 15 minutes), Secrets Manager integration, PG supports Kerberos/AD. The ceiling is <code>rds_superuser</code> — <strong>no SUPER privilege</strong>: you cannot edit <code>pg_hba.conf</code>, cannot <code>ALTER SYSTEM</code>, cannot create C-language functions, cannot install non-whitelisted extensions.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存储层压缩+按量计费自动优化）。 Aurora 存储层自动压缩与去重，存储按实际使用量计费，用户无需管理。官方文档 MySQL 兼容版继承 InnoDB 压缩；PG 兼容版继承 TOAST 压缩。官方文档 压缩为黑盒自动能力，用户侧无调优参数，压缩比不公开披露。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存储层压缩+按量计费自动优化）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora 存储层自动压缩与去重，存储按实际使用量计费，用户无需管理。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL 兼容版继承 InnoDB 压缩；PG 兼容版继承 TOAST 压缩。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>压缩为黑盒自动能力，用户侧无调优参数，压缩比不公开披露。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Storage-layer compression with usage-based auto-optimization). Aurora&#x27;s storage layer compresses and dedupes automatically with usage-based billing; no user ma…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Storage-layer compression with usage-based auto-optimization).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora&#x27;s storage layer compresses and dedupes automatically with usage-based billing; no user management needed. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The MySQL-compatible edition inherits InnoDB compression; the PostgreSQL-compatible edition inherits TOAST compression. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression is a black-box automatic capability with no user tunables and undisclosed ratios. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 深度绑定；存储层无法迁出）。 Aurora 是 AWS 托管服务，存储层（6 副本 quorum）与计算深度绑定 AWS，无法在 AWS 之外运行。官方文档 虽兼容 MySQL/PG 协议可降低应用层迁移成本，但存储与高可用架构必须重构。社区共识 无开源版本，协议风险即云锁定风险。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 深度绑定；存储层无法迁出）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora 是 AWS 托管服务，存储层（6 副本 quorum）与计算深度绑定 AWS，无法在 AWS 之外运行。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>虽兼容 MySQL/PG 协议可降低应用层迁移成本，但存储与高可用架构必须重构。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无开源版本，协议风险即云锁定风险。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Deeply AWS-bound; storage layer cannot leave). Aurora is an AWS managed service; its storage layer (6-copy quorum) and compute are deeply bound to AWS and cann…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Deeply AWS-bound; storage layer cannot leave).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora is an AWS managed service; its storage layer (6-copy quorum) and compute are deeply bound to AWS and cannot run outside it. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL/PostgreSQL protocol compatibility lowers application-layer migration cost, but the storage and HA architecture must be rebuilt. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No open-source edition; license risk is cloud lock-in risk. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（引擎优化器同 MySQL/PG；存储层透明）。 查询优化器与对应引擎（MySQL 8 / PG）一致，hint、EXPLAIN 行为相同 官方文档。 Aurora 的存储层优化对优化器透明，不改变计划选择逻辑 社区共识。 计划翻转的根因（统计信息、参数）与原生引擎相同 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（引擎优化器同 MySQL/PG；存储层透明）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>查询优化器与对应引擎（MySQL 8 / PG）一致，hint、EXPLAIN 行为相同 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Aurora 的存储层优化对优化器透明，不改变计划选择逻辑 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>计划翻转的根因（统计信息、参数）与原生引擎相同 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Same optimizer as MySQL/PG engine; storage invisible). Query optimizer matches the engine (MySQL 8 / PG): same hints and EXPLAIN behavior <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Auro…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Same optimizer as MySQL/PG engine; storage invisible).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Query optimizer matches the engine (MySQL 8 / PG): same hints and EXPLAIN behavior <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Aurora&#x27;s storage-layer optimizations are transparent to the optimizer <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Plan-flip root causes (statistics, parameters) mirror the native engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（参数组可调；Performance Insights 强）。 通过参数组调参，常用参数与原生引擎一致 官方文档。 Performance Insights、Enhanced Monitoring 诊断能力强 官方文档。 无自动索引/自动重写，自治能力弱于 AlloyDB 等 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（参数组可调；Performance Insights 强）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过参数组调参，常用参数与原生引擎一致 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Performance Insights、Enhanced Monitoring 诊断能力强 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无自动索引/自动重写，自治能力弱于 AlloyDB 等 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Parameter groups tunable; strong Performance Insights). Tuned via parameter groups, same common parameters as native engines <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Performance Insight…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Parameter groups tunable; strong Performance Insights).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuned via parameter groups, same common parameters as native engines <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Performance Insights and Enhanced Monitoring give strong diagnostics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No auto-indexing/rewrites; less autonomous than AlloyDB-class offerings <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（存储层 6 副本仲裁写，底层校验用户不可见）。 存储层 6 副本跨 AZ、quorum 写，单副本损坏可被仲裁掩盖，用户无可见校验开关。官方文档 MySQL 兼容版继承 InnoDB 页 checksum 与 doublewrite，但存储卸载后部分语义由云层接管。官方文档 用户无法主动触发全库校验或查看底层修复记录。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（存储层 6 副本仲裁写，底层校验用户不可见）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层 6 副本跨 AZ、quorum 写，单副本损坏可被仲裁掩盖，用户无可见校验开关。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL 兼容版继承 InnoDB 页 checksum 与 doublewrite，但存储卸载后部分语义由云层接管。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>用户无法主动触发全库校验或查看底层修复记录。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (6-copy quorum storage; hidden checks). Six-way cross-AZ storage with quorum writes masks single-copy corruption; no user-visible checksum controls. (official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (6-copy quorum storage; hidden checks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Six-way cross-AZ storage with quorum writes masks single-copy corruption; no user-visible checksum controls. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL-compatible edition inherits InnoDB page checksums and doublewrite, partly superseded by the offloaded storage layer. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Users cannot trigger full-database verification or inspect underlying repair logs. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（SP/触发器/事件完整）。 MySQL 版支持存储过程、触发器、事件调度；PG 版 plpgsql 完整 官方文档。 MySQL 过程语言无包、调试弱，去 O 迁移改写成本高 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（SP/触发器/事件完整）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版支持存储过程、触发器、事件调度；PG 版 plpgsql 完整 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL 过程语言无包、调试弱，去 O 迁移改写成本高 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full procedures/triggers/events). MySQL flavor: procedures, triggers, event scheduler; PG flavor: full plpgsql <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL procedural language lacks…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full procedures/triggers/events).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor: procedures, triggers, event scheduler; PG flavor: full plpgsql <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>MySQL procedural language lacks packages and debugging; Oracle migration rewrites are costly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（InnoDB 约束完整）。 InnoDB 外键、CHECK（8.0.16+ 强制）、唯一约束完整 官方文档。 外键级联大批量删除易放大写入与锁等待 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（InnoDB 约束完整）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>InnoDB 外键、CHECK（8.0.16+ 强制）、唯一约束完整 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>外键级联大批量删除易放大写入与锁等待 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full InnoDB constraints). Full InnoDB FK, enforced CHECK (8.0.16+), unique constraints <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. FK cascades on bulk deletes amplify writes and lock wai…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full InnoDB constraints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full InnoDB FK, enforced CHECK (8.0.16+), unique constraints <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>FK cascades on bulk deletes amplify writes and lock waits <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MySQL 8 窗口/CTE；PG 完整）。 MySQL 版：8.0 窗口函数、CTE（含递归）可用 官方文档。 复杂分析性能弱于 OLAP 引擎，大宽表关联仍是短板 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MySQL 8 窗口/CTE；PG 完整）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版：8.0 窗口函数、CTE（含递归）可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>复杂分析性能弱于 OLAP 引擎，大宽表关联仍是短板 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MySQL 8 windows/CTEs; full on PG). MySQL flavor: 8.0 window functions and CTEs (incl. recursive) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Complex analytics lag OLAP engines; wide-tabl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MySQL 8 windows/CTEs; full on PG).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor: 8.0 window functions and CTEs (incl. recursive) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Complex analytics lag OLAP engines; wide-table joins remain a weakness <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（手动DELETE；连续备份35天残留）。 Aurora 连续备份保留最长 35 天，被删数据在此窗口内可恢复 官方文档 快照为全量，删除合规需管理快照保留与删除 官方文档 无原生擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（手动DELETE；连续备份35天残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora 连续备份保留最长 35 天，被删数据在此窗口内可恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>快照为全量，删除合规需管理快照保留与删除 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无原生擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual DELETE; 35-day backup residue). Aurora continuous backups retain up to 35 days; deleted data is recoverable inside that window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Snapshots a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual DELETE; 35-day backup residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora continuous backups retain up to 35 days; deleted data is recoverable inside that window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Snapshots are full copies, so compliant deletion must manage snapshot retention and deletion <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Glue 爬网元数据；无原生血缘）。 Glue crawler 可抓取 Aurora 表元数据进 Data Catalog 官方文档。 无原生列级血缘，需第三方血缘工具 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Glue 爬网元数据；无原生血缘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Glue crawler 可抓取 Aurora 表元数据进 Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生列级血缘，需第三方血缘工具 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Glue-crawled metadata; no native lineage). Glue crawlers can catalog Aurora table metadata <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native column-level lineage; third-party tools nee…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Glue-crawled metadata; no native lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Glue crawlers can catalog Aurora table metadata <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native column-level lineage; third-party tools needed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续增量备份到 S3（对性能无影响）+ PITR 任意秒级恢复（保留期 1~35 天，恢复=建新集群）；手动快照；跨 Region 快照复制；克隆（copy-on-write）；Backtrack 仅 Aurora MySQL（建集群时启用，72 小时窗口）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续增量备份到 S3（对性能无影响）+ PITR 任意秒级恢复（保留期 1~35 天，恢复=建新集群）；手动快照；跨 Region 快照复制；克隆（copy-on-write）；Backtrack 仅 Aurora MySQL（建集群时启用，72 小时窗口）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous incremental backup to S3 (zero performance impact) + PITR recovery to any second (retention 1–35 days, recovery = create a new clust…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous incremental backup to S3 (zero performance impact) + PITR recovery to any second (retention 1–35 days, recovery = create a new cluster); manual snapshots; cross-Region snapshot copy; clone (copy-on-write); Backtrack only on Aurora MySQL (enabled at cluster creation, 72-hour window).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算分离标杆：分布式存储+计算分离）。 存储与计算分离，存储自动扩缩至 128TB，按使用量计费 官方文档。 存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，故障切换秒级 官方文档。 写入需经存储层仲裁，超高并发小事务延迟高于本地盘 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算分离标杆：分布式存储+计算分离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储与计算分离，存储自动扩缩至 128TB，按使用量计费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，故障切换秒级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写入需经存储层仲裁，超高并发小事务延迟高于本地盘 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Disaggregation benchmark: distributed storage, split compute). Storage/compute separated; storage auto-scales to 128TB, pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 6 storage …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Disaggregation benchmark: distributed storage, split compute).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Storage/compute separated; storage auto-scales to 128TB, pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>6 storage copies across 3 AZs; failover in seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Writes arbitrate through the storage layer; ultra-high-concurrency small transactions lag local disks <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（随引擎：MySQL JSON / PG 向量生态）。 Aurora MySQL：JSON 类型+全文索引；Aurora PG：jsonb、pgvector（RDS 系支持）官方文档。 无原生图/时序引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（随引擎：MySQL JSON / PG 向量生态）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：JSON 类型+全文索引；Aurora PG：jsonb、pgvector（RDS 系支持）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图/时序引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Engine-dependent: MySQL JSON / PG vectors). Aurora MySQL: JSON type + full-text; Aurora PG: jsonb, pgvector (RDS-family support) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native graph…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Engine-dependent: MySQL JSON / PG vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: JSON type + full-text; Aurora PG: jsonb, pgvector (RDS-family support) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native graph/time-series engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 标签归因+Budgets 预算告警）。 支持成本分配标签，Cost Explorer 按集群/实例/标签维度分析 Aurora 支出。官方文档 AWS Budgets 支持预算阈值告警；Serverless v2 按 ACU 秒级计量。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 标签归因+Budgets 预算告警）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持成本分配标签，Cost Explorer 按集群/实例/标签维度分析 Aurora 支出。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>AWS Budgets 支持预算阈值告警；Serverless v2 按 ACU 秒级计量。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS tags, Cost Explorer, Budgets). Cost allocation tags let Cost Explorer break down Aurora spend by cluster, instance, or tag. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> AWS Budgets sup…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS tags, Cost Explorer, Budgets).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cost allocation tags let Cost Explorer break down Aurora spend by cluster, instance, or tag. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>AWS Budgets supports budget threshold alerts; Serverless v2 meters ACU usage per second. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（原生协议兼容；RDS Proxy 增强）。 完全兼容 MySQL/PG 协议与驱动 官方文档。 RDS Proxy 提供连接池与故障切换加速 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（原生协议兼容；RDS Proxy 增强）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全兼容 MySQL/PG 协议与驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RDS Proxy 提供连接池与故障切换加速 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native protocol compatible; RDS Proxy enhanced). Fully compatible with MySQL/PG protocols and drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RDS Proxy adds pooling and faster failov…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native protocol compatible; RDS Proxy enhanced).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully compatible with MySQL/PG protocols and drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RDS Proxy adds pooling and faster failover <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 版手动物化视图；MySQL 版无）。 Aurora PG：物化视图手动 REFRESH（含 CONCURRENTLY）官方文档。 Aurora MySQL：无物化视图，靠汇总表+触发器/定时任务模拟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 版手动物化视图；MySQL 版无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PG：物化视图手动 REFRESH（含 CONCURRENTLY）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Aurora MySQL：无物化视图，靠汇总表+触发器/定时任务模拟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual MVs on PG; none on MySQL). Aurora PG: materialized views with manual REFRESH (incl. CONCURRENTLY) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Aurora MySQL: none; summary tables + tr…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual MVs on PG; none on MySQL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aurora PG: materialized views with manual REFRESH (incl. CONCURRENTLY) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Aurora MySQL: none; summary tables + triggers/jobs instead <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（AWS 绑定，无跨云）。 仅 AWS，无其他云版本 官方文档。 迁出靠 DMS/逻辑导出，无跨云原生复制 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（AWS 绑定，无跨云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅 AWS，无其他云版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁出靠 DMS/逻辑导出，无跨云原生复制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud). AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Moving out via DMS/logical export; no native cross-cloud replication (offici…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Moving out via DMS/logical export; no native cross-cloud replication <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（MySQL 线有锁释放优化，PG 线靠应用层）。 MySQL 线并发原语：InnoDB 行级记录锁，后来者排队等锁，等待时长受 innodb_lock_wait_timeout（默认 50 秒）限制；环路死锁由内核检测并回滚代价较小的一方（报 1213），重试由应用负责；热点行即串行单点 官方文档。 MySQL 线内置缓解：20…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（MySQL 线有锁释放优化，PG 线靠应用层）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 线并发原语：InnoDB 行级记录锁，后来者排队等锁，等待时长受 innodb_lock_wait_timeout（默认 50 秒）限制；环路死锁由内核检测并回滚代价较小的一方（报 1213），重试由应用负责；热点行即串行单点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL 线内置缓解：2016 年 v1.10 以 lab mode 引入针对热页/热点行的锁释放算法改进，官方称 TPC-C 场景最高 16 倍提升；该优化在当前大版本中是否为默认开启未找到明确证据 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL 线衰减与运维：高并发热点下死锁检测本身的 CPU 开销会成为瓶颈，社区常见做法是关闭 innodb_deadlock_detect、调小锁等待超时并由应用重试；代价是真正的死锁要等到超时才释放 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 线：行锁行为与社区 PG 一致——后来者排队、死锁检测常开、重试靠应用；官方明确指出行锁竞争与存算分离的存储层无关；官方推荐应用层&quot;行拆分&quot;（row splitting）模式，称可将吞吐从约 4900 提升到 21000+ TPS <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：两条线通用模式为短事务、计数器分片、队列削峰；MySQL 线还可用 RDS Proxy 合并连接；代价是读聚合复杂度、短暂不一致窗口与额外组件运维 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (lock-release optimization on the MySQL line, application layer on the PG line). MySQL line concurrency primitive: InnoDB row-level record locks, late…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (lock-release optimization on the MySQL line, application layer on the PG line).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL line concurrency primitive: InnoDB row-level record locks, later writers queue for the lock, bounded by innodb_lock_wait_timeout (default 50s); deadlocks are detected by the engine, which rolls back the cheaper side (error 1213), and retry is the application&#x27;s job; a hot row is a serialization point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>MySQL line built-in mitigation: a new lock-release algorithm for hot-page/hot-row contention shipped in v1.10 (2016) behind lab mode, with AWS claiming up to 16x TPC-C improvement; no clear evidence was found on whether it is enabled by default in current major versions (to be verified).</li>\n<li>MySQL line decay and operations: under high-concurrency hotspots the deadlock detector&#x27;s own CPU cost becomes the bottleneck; the common community practice is to disable innodb_deadlock_detect, lower the lock-wait timeout, and retry in the application — at the cost of true deadlocks only being released on timeout <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>PG line: row-lock behavior matches community PostgreSQL — queuing, always-on deadlock detection, application-owned retry; AWS states row-lock contention is independent of the disaggregated storage layer; AWS recommends the application-level &quot;row splitting&quot; pattern, claiming roughly 4,900 to 21,000+ TPS <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Application patterns and cost for both lines: short transactions, counter sharding, queue-based peak shaving, plus connection coalescing via RDS Proxy on the MySQL line; costs are read aggregation complexity, brief consistency windows, and extra components to operate <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});